.TH PISTATS-BACKEND 1 "September 2026" "OwnNode Agent 1.4.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pistats-backend \- run OwnNode Agent on a Raspberry Pi
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pistats-backend
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pistats-backend
starts the private HTTP API used by OwnNode clients. The Debian system service
loads configuration from
.IR /etc/pistats/pistats.env .
.PP
The default configuration listens only on 127.0.0.1:8787 and requires the
generated bearer token. Network exposure, Wake-on-LAN, backup-drive hints,
media storage, and Actual Budget transaction sync are opt-in. Docker monitoring
selections are managed by clients.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/pistats/pistats.env
Persistent service configuration and bearer token.
.TP
.I /var/lib/pistats
Private service state directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR journalctl (1)
.PP
Project documentation: https://github.com/ZenDeveloper7/OwnNode-Agent
